      "idea": "Give the name column a little more room while keeping the first four columns within 359 px. Check that both alpha headers and all codes remain intact and whether the name header improves."
    },
    {
      "widths": [103, 45, 55, 49, 69, 38],
      "idea": "Fit within 359 px by moving width from the independence column to the link column. Test whether link suffixes stay together more often while Yes and No remain readable; the independence header will remain fragmented."
    }
  ]
